<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n49192" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θρομβό-ομαι</span></b> , 
			Pass.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to become clotted,
				curdled</i>, of blood, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				315
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				18(1).33
			</span></i>; of honey, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				14.22
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>contain clots</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἢν θρομβωθέωσιν αἱ μῆτραι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.165
				</span></i>
			; of the breasts, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				<u>Eup.</u>
				1.128
			</span></i>:—
				Act.
			, <i>cause to coagulate</i>, only as v.l.
			in Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				709
			</span></i>.</div>
